th $(4x).$ This gives\n\n$$\n4x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi .\n$$\n\nSolving for $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4x & =\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi  \\\\ x & =\\frac{\\pi }{8}+\\frac{n\\pi }{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the zeros are $x=\\frac{\\pi }{8}+\\frac{n\\pi }{4},$ where $n$ is an integer." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-81545/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fabd8865-cc14-508a-aa81-4ba147f7f8d4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-81545"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-117670/selection/caa8edc46c2cd89a1760c4445c8a94dc776fd082414e3146deb83629790adb78" :answer/id #uuid "9cfca77a-46d9-5a9a-abfd-8f0a756dd206" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{\\pi }{3}+4n\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117670/selection/9e264ef7d26ceef08f31534aad461cbce912b655b74452bb879c42887663d201" :answer/id #uuid "fd6a47b0-70f8-5535-91bc-f37d35f31daa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{4\\pi }{3}+n\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117670/selection/edcfd6d065adde0faa5b121e19e939fbfc479e1b0983648d0db0808f5856d63f" :answer/id #uuid "93450cc6-63e0-5676-8344-8f81d2d5c438" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{4\\pi }{3}+4n\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117670/selection/ead9790f7586f980fedd054a7c3d0622278661e7446130513d30e2e892d87cda" :answer/id #uuid "3c65af0b-b5f1-5b72-a2b0-90f29d5c40fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{\\pi }{3}+2n\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117670/selection/deb0e5183481b9e0783ff2f6cab7a35d606991cb9ac2a6f8e5551ec2e9aac832" :answer/id #uuid "0b7254f5-1d63-5878-9cfb-9f334bc87dfd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{2\\pi }{3}+2n\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117670/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4c42ceb1-23a1-5acb-8615-0e4d492ed9f8" :answer-field/key "selection" :a