ollowing expressions gives all of the vertical asymptotes of the function  $f(x)=\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\pi x)?$ Assume that $n$ is an integer." :question/worked-solution "The asymptotes of $y=\\operatorname{cot}⁡x$ are given by the expression\n\n$$\nx=n\\pi ,\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is an integer.\n\nTo find the asymptotes of $\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\pi x),$ we replace the $x$ on the left-hand side of the above with $(\\pi x).$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\pi x=n\\pi .\n$$\n\nSolving for $x,$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\pi x & =n\\pi  \\\\ x & =n.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the expression giving all the vertical asymptotes is $x=n,$ where $n$ is an integer." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-81556/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8854eaba-96c7-5ea8-a071-7ff7c954f943"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-81556"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-29349/selection/78af4992da31eb627d34155af605cc930ec67b07a4bf286b75fce79ac587f74a" :answer/id #uuid "2fecbb8b-1cd1-545c-9f15-7eb5277f8712" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x={60}^{∘}+n\\cdot {45}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-29349/selection/1a21102038fe74ee913054cdc6aaabe3c7b7fc13a662000f0d4678049ee40fb9" :answer/id #uuid "0432cfc9-68fb-5ad7-aa9e-7e5cf4bdb790" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=n\\cdot {180}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-29349/selection/adcb6902045f38a1af87ea80b824ea3d63d35b3ac87e1c46a4ed6b20451e9b90" :answer/id #uuid "2f309a7a-17f6-5e7d-98b3-afffa62139ff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x={45}^{∘}+n\\cdot {90}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-29349/selection/aef21d3c5ab1596b65bad3142ea6e4caa99b57727ad049f978f6fa268ff8f39a" :answer/id #uuid "a8c72aa2-6df8-5857-bcd6-f4c8f1702be2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x={30}^{∘}+n\\cdot {180}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-29349/selection