4x+\\frac{\\pi }{4}),$ we replace the $x$ on the left-hand side of the above with $(4x+\\frac{\\pi }{4}).$ This gives\n\n$$\n4x+\\frac{\\pi }{4}=\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi .\n$$\n\nSolving for $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4x+\\frac{\\pi }{4} & =\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi  \\\\ 4x & =\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi -\\frac{\\pi }{4} \\\\ 4x & =\\frac{\\pi }{4}+n\\pi  \\\\ x & =\\frac{\\pi }{16}+\\frac{n\\pi }{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the expression giving all the vertical asymptotes is $x=\\frac{\\pi }{16}+\\frac{n\\pi }{4},$ where $n$ is an integer." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-117698/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8854eaba-96c7-5ea8-a071-7ff7c954f943"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-117698"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-81559/selection/2b9aca7287330040e61d70cc05bbc583e592d3bf8c4f46a7d34977281e0709d0" :answer/id #uuid "23c2f59f-0d75-591c-a710-db98736a57a1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{\\pi }{16}+\\frac{n\\pi }{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81559/selection/7a5d3a8ff99b3e6deb748e41c750187c6a85547010a805e21853273f269dfae3" :answer/id #uuid "6c277e54-359d-57f2-ae00-bbebefa65d0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{\\pi }{3}+\\frac{n\\pi }{12}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81559/selection/f9ed4d40dcec6592bc318996c6b30c574e81fb7602d7e72c7fa4c44458513b36" :answer/id #uuid "b1612d91-cd69-5206-a59b-2365a53e62af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{\\pi }{4}+\\frac{n\\pi }{10}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81559/selection/fd5d75f8a071bc71385ea255fa08da3ae7939a20077e0b7271eb31015431ab0d" :answer/id #uuid "fe60d7a4-ff8a-5e42-a5dc-7b44bc40c3dc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{\\pi }{6}+\\frac{n\\pi }{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81559/selection/29de2f68d54155663d1b629918f25a1897c01202ae8978ef89877b